{
  "5": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:97bc16344073a813da2f3eb329d981b5c9385f93a340f07c2db1040eff28e3ee",
      "text": "COSMIC GRAVURE POWERRR!!!",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "9": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:e35f2643d9d6f264d8da12b8effc4a06dd7a7cb712d96ad261da89a2e2aa1456",
      "text": "Beaucy, camera at ten o'clock!\nGive them your eyes!!",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "14": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:b1e355c69c58d7e2aa72f959fbf1223819151dca4fa0fad1d1f53fc521c215eb",
      "text": "Cowdy.\nI'll finish this...!",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "17": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:beff3ab4c44df37c68bce6c752866c4fd9a3dd93fa8b81c76f94a5b8bd0ada8f",
      "text": "Chateaubrilliand!\nVT Candid Shot!!",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "21": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:59d4f8b50f4829c9108779996c08eccc96d389678375d6aacce41dbd15f29fdc",
      "text": "GOOOOOD!!\nGreat work, Beaucy!\nAnother perfect shoot today!!",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "24": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:896ad1e97faeb44d5e4b97a412b533784ae0a123d32bf499968e23ae62ab8d84",
      "text": "Amazing... So this is how the\nOculus gravure shoots are made.",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "28": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:6c0103a219206ad7532a921c19e3ac595ee141789634dd9933205f94fd59be7c",
      "text": "How very interesting...",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "33": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:da1330e1f2f9b58f10a99644889431bc6d532c66a0fa249e70fdc2b1b3b0f4a8",
      "text": "No, no! I think this is a\nvery special case...?!",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "38": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:3d2622bdc1c7ea4a8e2c1bf22ef4e51c72dea583f7341b2e5064249d9864925e",
      "text": "Cowdy.\nYou all came.",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "42": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:1e54a4dbaa2a10d35d77ac4bd21477b3fec744ec5f0dcf538392eb473422c77f",
      "text": "Yeah, just dropping by. Our\nrequest was nearby, so we thought\nwe'd watch.",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "46": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:f944b316f4fafef0120afe7a5ec16eb7059cf29354cc49a37fd6f37b8df895e5",
      "text": "Shooting during Valentine's Fest...\nBeing a gravure idol is tough.",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "51": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:443f54f2c4819cb4ca44010e8b2dff5338040a703c964f438c5921337c25fe66",
      "text": "This shoot is an off-shot from the\nfest. The setting is a secret\nholiday date.",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "56": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:90be90a77baccea8a60690054b9c1fe51b683e6bb4f70d3635b3c5b96e9973d1",
      "text": "...I see? Looks casual, but the\noutfit is flawless too. The mood\ncomes through. That's sneaky...!",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "61": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:854b033279e16d10a5dafc6c4ccc2bc44d1f61c57639045eb7eea507349537b4",
      "text": "Cacow looks lovely, too.",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "66": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:28979a5d1b91866c523e97b6851097b20b21ee74530f094ce29c9842c06a550a",
      "text": "Cowdy.\nThank you, Stella.",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "72": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:575a5d53a5a1ced54b1aa75478aabaa5c6435e0ce19d98e18e8568201f045272",
      "text": "What's wrong?\nIs there some trouble?",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "75": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:322cff970607706c7028cf6b90141be14dd9f6c60c593cec43569ce3dc1e6479",
      "text": "Oh, no! It's not this shoot.\nIt's the mini live in the plaza\nafter this...",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "77": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:d3eb60c4bc986c5377434f8b014084187ee12564d9bc6ef8c6d9fba742e25512",
      "text": "There was a mix-up booking some of\nthe idols, so the live might get\ncanceled.",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "79": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:600c520f07c9cc1c59cf4108b3300608b97ee51c3cbd1aea074040f038a7d283",
      "text": "It's a shame, but it can't be\nhelped. It's a small stage, so the\ndamage won't be that big—",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "82": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:a43c40dab1bb66566a6cd160191cd40a84092b2847dc0c3f47e3b38f3049edce",
      "text": "That won't do...!\nThe people looking forward to it\nwill be sad.",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "86": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:c79d3acde1ae61d9b58ecc60bffb755c81b3c7be14d7d0d9d7f40b5d2bb8b0ee",
      "text": "Mainly me...!\nVery much so...!!",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "89": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:f1d7b3c526a541e36e74c41740e6c9564d9f0f0dbceb69e90309d3c12c9aa9cb",
      "text": "B-but we can't find a substitute\nidol. Everyone's schedule is\nbooked solid this time of year—",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "93": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:63610490e6b572d0f5a61cbcea74ad70f30d34b164be3205dc2c6a12b1bf1536",
      "text": "Cowdy...!\nIn that case, I'll lend a hand.",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "97": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:3d1fcd17b2e41a1078953910b37533da0a78d7c6eaf758274978027698cc7a66",
      "text": "This is my list of up-and-coming\nidols and underground idols I check\non and support.",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "101": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:e1ee528ea0b42ca3a55182bc5b5a46a054a5ccb2dba8378d4a4b4053255b12d1",
      "text": "They might jump at this chance and\nrush over. ...Though don't push\nthem too hard.",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "104": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:b275dd1ea8e01425240ee05c6a449db33af303ef92af9501b3267eccf53b5775",
      "text": "Th-thank you...!!",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "107": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:efdb617ec6c4b51175117944011efbbb615460c1a84d696f04ffcb145c24917a",
      "text": "Don't mention it.\nBut that list is classified. Don't\nshow it to anyone but staff.",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "110": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:caa12d6c93342612dd92155113bd45fd72d596943eb94f9fb7e9f9a21c4e3ef4",
      "text": "We'll help the staff as we are.\nWe'll see you later—",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "114": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:c631aca4115271cc3e59bc1879bcc6a2c2e344ec116ad424d31f388cd70996de",
      "text": "We'll help, too.",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "118": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:9f6ecc4559c492df738dc9005451ed1f8de94d6dbcffce0b082a8251853766c4",
      "text": "If we split up to negotiate, more\npeople is better, right? Don't worry,\nI have some experience.",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "123": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:df306cdd524dc890c273dfae2c0228b698a6f1c8a4519daddc34fe732a980821",
      "text": "...Cowdy.\nThank you.",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "134": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:de22b77a65a8c6ce255ba5512ccdb890cef694f8bfbdf1d96ddc66cbd67fe817",
      "text": "Cowdy...!\nHow did the negotiations go?",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "138": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:bf6b1dc2dd3fb0214f091fa4156bc444d50a0f2aea37a6decb74ae62f84d8376",
      "text": "It's fine. The planned slot looks\nlike it's filled.",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "142": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:f560897dd171e351182340403d95baa6d86bf686be0cb91f789b5a39c954ac25",
      "text": "...But the performers may be late\nto the stage. They're hurrying,\nbut—",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "147": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:18cb54267a5d3dd25825975468a0025a94d39dc5f14bb919514b36a03b669e23",
      "text": "...We need to stall.",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "152": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:8672e330a43f0769e350738fb8457292a3e403a32a95aa85c5eb6e13431c94aa",
      "text": "Beaucy...!\nYou don't mean you're...?!",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "155": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:b35ba13772dae2c718a3999f9bb58953308cf96e2b147de467f4685435ea498e",
      "text": "Thank you for that lovely love\nsong!! Up next is... huh? The next\nact isn't here yet? Um...!",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "158": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:7fcc042f9bf74b2aba02e35d4896d802f68803eb8e4872dc3cdf3b58489dfa69",
      "text": "—The next idol to sing is me.",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "162": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:9d06edd767027ccb04c7bc1a59dc95ca671a339a4b104574f6a3c9b394b2b00d",
      "text": "Hey, Alk. Beaucy's a gravure idol,\nbut can she do a live?",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "166": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:5e9573b8f48427d16939e8776bc01e32c070226fca37065e87b5bb5e12bd2321",
      "text": "I don't know. But we've seen how\nhard she's been working...!",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "172": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:dd8082c26717fd5dba2a1bb52744394b39886be701c9a33ae9ee21478db603d9",
      "text": "Cowdy.\nI'm proud of being a gravure idol.",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "175": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:31bb81e41f35d5735a66c31b4c3b2276fb9386f4d39c93e97c542fd817e3350e",
      "text": "But today, here, I will take up my\nold dream once more.",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "179": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:a3f7cc6ccbf2c966079ebe28e51088fef8b81dc83c7ad84f13bf7aca275be9ad",
      "text": "Let's do it, Beaucy. To win both\ncrowns: Normal Idol and Gravure\nIdol—!!",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "185": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:b185d0f0ebe571372a577f2e4044a6085952717d3208af1ec979e19e20f996d5",
      "text": "Cowdy.\n—COSMIC IDOL POWERRR!!",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "194": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:ea224750038d1e2d222b89510fd18ff49860de780c529f2db850b97fba8e14ec",
      "text": "Cow~~~dy~~~♪\nCowdy, cow~~dy~~~dy~~~~♪",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "198": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:5d22e153eb3ef021bd902e094f396ac9ce2cb65ed0730172efddc83bed426af7",
      "text": "We can't... keep the audience\nconnected like this...!",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "202": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:7471dbc9a1a633a3642bc40e7094fbfdb258ae4979c7b90475b1e85d7531f766",
      "text": "She tried hard! She really did\ntry hard...!!",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "205": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:9918dcd4b91dbf7e5222acc5f1ac053ea7ab4cb6d9fdf2416de07253a63f898c",
      "text": "What are we even watching?!\nWait, is it actually good, in its\nown way...?!",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "208": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:9c937536055a948c8abaadc080869dc2ba91b83a817acb08346273aafdb10ec7",
      "text": "Ugh...!\nMy skills still aren't enough—",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "213": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:d926f3beb4d3c0a94a4c773c7c454a73d9b98011be2568d3e188c4a7154f4862",
      "text": "Sorry to keep you waiting!!",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "217": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:1d40fc2cc318db9ede7be471a0f2d70a9128dc1fc210d7aacf595075fb17bf14",
      "text": "D-did we... make it...?",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "221": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:bb66b620bdbba76e85c836f146c3eb02ea0b3e6011845f12c9fbb36e32bf3cd1",
      "text": "Y-yeah...! It was perfect timing!",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "226": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:d4ddee082fb4dd9133b9d95a1aaec89b71c4006aef23fe2cfc4efe38075d08e0",
      "text": "Leave the rest to Noenne and\nthe gang!\n—Knockin' Heart Miracle! On fire!!",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "233": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:f4fce02916595c0d2b168e018369c76b5a02bc05bf06f583468a07305521f31e",
      "text": "Hey... We got through it\nsomehow.",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "237": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:6212639746beb53ec68d206446aef45a95b767e56eaa599f0ecf27ec8971d0c9",
      "text": "Cowdy.\nThanks to the staff and you all.",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "240": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:e8722b90b8508f90eca4c4753aeb95061d5cbbd224b57c969f0422094963ce38",
      "text": "...But it hit home. I'm still far\nfrom an idol who can sing\nand dance.",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "245": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:91a3194e3c85d8b2f57d06db703d9fb640237a7013ccbf3471680e039013a7ea",
      "text": "Really? It may not have been a\nsuccess, but—",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "249": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:e7f1f3d2b41a203d8da8f467a1980ebaa28275488966674be2019fe35aac7d4d",
      "text": "No. I know best how an idol should\nbe judged.",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "252": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:035f42b4277a7481af208c137cf19218676b98163563df58e940315a3c06f9a9",
      "text": "But still—I'm glad I took a step\nforward.",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "255": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:89049e601c743e6450902059f87ec32ea6d2c0b4b325b20c1ee1f60f59093518",
      "text": "From now on, I'll keep training\nsteadily, without rushing.",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "259": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:2edcdfa92b1a48cee124b305dbc680525e777201dc7c2b45af05fd8cc33d2d15",
      "text": "...I see. So that's Beaucy.",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "264": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:f487e4a68eb19410c02a11f3e21628b262f3c7330a1141ed05297a576a0dd19c",
      "text": "Cowdy.\nMore importantly,\nlet's enjoy the live now.",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "269": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:1affda69af793505049fa072191a5a571e8f040a536644a5719e780e403b50c0",
      "text": "She's on your favorites list, so\nyou must like her a lot.",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "273": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:1d793b03ef72c33840fb5062a711420873add67232f67302792b7534965e1851",
      "text": "I said it was classified, did I not?",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "277": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:91cabd5325be0eacb6d38ee6b1f1cfafa88a47eff37dd1763050b9bf53e22522",
      "text": "Right. Sorry.",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "281": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:67e3e1760eb1129d4868b6c375d175021b3dc27f1fee66ca0d66cbe3ff7cfe4a",
      "text": "Cowdy.\nAs long as you understand.",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "285": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:4fa2eee4ff08a79f3f737bd9e47e6c25370945224a857e17cb7dbefae8c7dc67",
      "text": "La~la la~♪\nLa~la~la~~~♪",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "290": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:56e6c95066fb53f89951dc9ab62089ed6f350dad21bb056cf1ab22c82add4f33",
      "text": "...Heh.\nIt looks like it'll be another\nlovely Valentine's Fest this year.",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  }
}
